WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:05.772
Welcome to Manulife Vitality Stories!

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:09.042
Once upon a time, Jean got a new Apple Watch 

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.610
and here’s the twist: 

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.948
she got it at a huge discount thanks to her 
Manulife Vitality Plus membership!

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:20.186
The first chapter in Jean’s Apple
Watch story was to order it.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.321
It was easy!

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:25.992
She just logged into her online account,
chose her model and ordered it.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.928
You can also use the app.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:34.100
In Chapter 2, Jean was kept up to date with ordering and shipping confirmation emails. 

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:37.771
Then within eight weeks it was at her door and on her wrist

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:45.178
Next, Chapter 3 showed her the easy on-screen instructions to pair her watch with her iPhone

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:46.746
then connect it to the program. 

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:50.450
First, she opened her Manulife Vitality app.  

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:55.121
It was her first time connecting the Health app, so a pop-up guided her through the easy process.   

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:59.692
If you’re reconnecting the Health app, you won’t see that pop-up.  

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:06.800
So, click “Profile,” then “Apps and Devices.” Select “Health app,” then click the “Connect” button. 

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:11.037
When your Health app opens, click “Sharing” and then “Apps and Services.”

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:14.641
Select “Manulife Vitality” and then “Turn On All.”

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:19.345
From there, you’ll be ready to get moving and earn Vitality Points 

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:23.216
which led Jean to Chapter 4!

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:31.558
When Jean moves – and even sleeps – her watch and the app can record it all, including her steps and heart rate.

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:35.628
And all that can translate to Vitality Points and rewards!

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:39.833
Finally, Chapter 5 is the end – or is it? 

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:46.339
Jean’s Apple Watch story truly has no end, because it’s all about moving forward with Manulife Vitality!

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:53.313
Now it’s time to get moving, so you can enjoy your Apple Watch – and Manulife Vitality – as much as Jean does!  

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:57.317
Want to check out more Manulife Vitality “how-to” stories? 

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:02.655
Click on one of the other videos you see here, then you could live happily ever after!  

